 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "One constructor",
   "items": [
    "The direct collectors, the sweep and the MCP host all call build_evidence, so states mean the same thing on every path"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Truncation is not blocking",
   "items": [
    "A cut list is partial but still usable; any other error with no items is denied or missing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "denied vs missing",
   "items": [
    "denied: tool_not_allowed, scope_violation, auth or forbidden; says nothing about the resources",
    "missing: no observation (unavailable, timeout, protocol, schema, oversized, invalid output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "stale",
   "items": [
    "A sixth state, stale, is computed by readers with state_at(now, max_age); it is never stored"
   ]
  }
 ]
